--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e9620f8c34305754d8cc9a7e49e852d9, type: 3}
  m_Name: Meltdown_en
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.Localization::UnityEngine.Localization.Tables.StringTable
  m_LocaleId:
    m_Code: en
  m_SharedData: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6566d6d7410996c46a34f719ba3d9f33, type: 2}
  m_Metadata:
    m_Items:
    - rid: 5599358745442254925
  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 326709248
    m_Localized: Meltdown
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 339292160
    m_Localized: The Ascalon platform
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 339292161
    m_Localized: Search the abandoned Ascalon platform.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 339292162
    m_Localized: The scientist
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 339292163
    m_Localized: Hail the research station Meridian and escort its shuttle safely into a hangar of the fleet.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 339292164
    m_Localized: The sacred rock
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 339292165
    m_Localized: 'Mine the large rock next to the Kethran Vigil for solarite, then get the miner to safety: into a hangar or out of the zone. The station''s fighters defend the rock.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 339292166
    m_Localized: Refining
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 339292167
    m_Localized: 'Dock the ship carrying the solarite at the abandoned Tamsin Forge. Nobody lives there: the furnace only runs while a ship with a crew is docked, about 4 minutes in all. The station is radioactive: take turns docking. Then land the refined solarite in a hangar.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 339292168
    m_Localized: Ignition
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 339292169
    m_Localized: 'Dock the ship carrying the refined solarite at the abandoned Calder Array. Its generator only runs while a ship with a crew is docked: 7 minutes until ignition. Then jump the fleet out of the system before the star collapses.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 339292170
    m_Localized: Search party on {station}
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 5599358745442254925
  - m_Id: 339292171
    m_Localized: "Alarm! Opening the reactor room woke up an experimental power source \u2013 it is going critical! About {seconds} seconds left. The logs name the maker: {manufacturer}. Their prototype came from a research station nearby. We are getting out \u2013 pull every ship out of the zone!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 5599358745442254925
  - m_Id: 339292172
    m_Localized: "This is {scientist} on {station}. The blast at Ascalon was my reactor \u2013 a small one. I have the plans for a far bigger version, and the Pronin know it. Take me with you. My shuttle launches the moment you cover it."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 5599358745442254925
  - m_Id: 339292173
    m_Localized: We will cover you. Launch.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 339292174
    m_Localized: Not yet.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 339292175
    m_Localized: Launching now. Get me to your fleet in one piece.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 339292176
    m_Localized: Do not wait too long. The Pronin are listening.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 339292177
    m_Localized: "Thank you. Now the truth: built large, my generator can set off a supernova. A weapon against the Pronin. But it needs a refined mineral \u2013 and I know where to find the rock."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 106988297596928
    m_Localized: Solarite
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 106988305985536
    m_Localized: Refined solarite
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 106988305985537
    m_Localized: Keeper of the {station}
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 5599358745442254925
  - m_Id: 106988305985538
    m_Localized: This is the {station}. The great rock at our side is sacred to us. Whoever lays hands on it will meet our guardians.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 5599358745442254925
  - m_Id: 106988305985539
    m_Localized: We understand.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 106988305985540
    m_Localized: We need what is inside it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 106988305985541
    m_Localized: Then go in peace.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 106988305985542
    m_Localized: Then you will have to take it from us. We will not give it up.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 106988305985543
    m_Localized: "You lay hands on the sacred rock! Guardians \u2013 drive them off!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 106988305985544
    m_Localized: "That is it \u2013 solarite. Raw, it is useless for the generator. It has to be refined, and I know a refinery whose furnace still works. Its crew left long ago \u2013 the radiation drove them out."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 106988305985545
    m_Localized: "Automatic refinery {station}. Personnel aboard: none. Reactor shielding: failed \u2013 lethal radiation on prolonged stay. Furnace ready for solarite, about {minutes} minutes. Operation needs a crew on site: keep a ship docked."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 5599358745442254925
  - m_Id: 106988305985546
    m_Localized: "The solarite is in the furnace. Nobody else is here \u2013 we keep the plant running ourselves. The dosimeters are already ticking."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 106988305985547
    m_Localized: "The furnace is done. The refined solarite is aboard \u2013 we are heading home."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 139465003184128
    m_Localized: Control system of the {station}
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 5599358745442254925
  - m_Id: 126382620880896
    m_Localized: Crew of {ship}
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 5599358745442254925
  - m_Id: 139465015767040
    m_Localized: Refining
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 139465015767041
    m_Localized: Ignition sequence
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 139465015767042
    m_Localized: "Power station {station}, Halvorsen Kinetics. Personnel aboard: none. Supernova generator: intact. Fuel: missing \u2013 insert refined solarite. Ignition sequence about {minutes} minutes; it needs a crew at the controls."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 5599358745442254925
  - m_Id: 139465015767043
    m_Localized: "The solarite is in the core. Dr. Morrow is talking us through the ignition sequence \u2013 keep us docked, whatever happens."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 139465015767044
    m_Localized: "It is burning! In {minutes} minutes this star collapses \u2013 and takes every Pronin ship in the system with it. Get everyone into the hangars and jump. Now!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 5599358745442254925
  - m_Id: 139465015767045
    m_Localized: "Behind us, {system} has just become a new sun. The Pronin fleet that hunted us is gone, down to the last ship. We have not won the war. But for the first time, we have time \u2013 time to find a new home."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 5599358745442254925
